   "text": "I checked the courier log and you're right. The Saffron Lane order (K-6101) was promised for 6:00 PM and handed to you at 6:50 PM, which is 50 minutes late. You didn't get any updated delivery time beforehand, so it's measured against the original 6:00.\n\nFor orders 45 or more minutes late, we give account credit of 20% of the food subtotal. Your subtotal was $60.00, so I've added **$12.00 in account credit** to your account. Your credit balance is now $12.00, and it'll apply to future orders. Late deliveries are compensated with credit rather than a refund to your card.\n\nWhat's the next order?"
