  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Sorry you got the wrong burger. I've checked this order and it qualifies: the handoff was yesterday at 7:40 PM, so you're within the 48-hour window, and there's no restaurant issue or earlier refund on it. The veggie burger was $11.00.\n\nNormally you could pick between an $11.00 card refund or $13.20 in credit. But credit given in a single conversation is capped at $25.00, and you've already received $17.40 today. Another $13.20 would go over that cap, so this one has to be a **refund of $11.00 to your Visa ending 4242**.\n\nDo you want me to go ahead with that refund?"
