   "text": "I've refunded **$11.00 to your Visa ending 4242** for the wrong burger (refund ID RF-4000). It should show up in 3\u20135 business days.\n\nAbout the cap: Forkful limits how much account credit can be issued in one support conversation. Standard accounts can get up to $25.00 per conversation, and Forkful Plus members up to $40.00. When an item would go over the cap, it's refunded to your card instead, so you still get the money back, just to your card rather than as credit.\n\nThat leaves two orders I haven't looked at yet: today's **Pho Real (K-6104)** and the **Taqueria Luz (K-6103)** from Oct 21. Which one had a problem, and what happened?"
