   "text": "I understand why you're annoyed about the churros. Forkful has to have some cutoff for missing-item reports, and it's set at 48 hours from delivery. I can't make exceptions to it, so I can't compensate that order.\n\nThe Pho Real order (K-6104) is already sorted. At 12:20 PM today, before your order was picked up, the restaurant marked the iced coffee as unavailable. Our system then **automatically refunded the $4.75 to your Visa ending 4242** at 12:21 PM. That refund should reach your card within a few business days. Since you've already been refunded for the coffee, I can't add anything more for it.\n\nHere's everything we covered today:\n- **K-6101 Saffron Lane:** $12.00 credit for the late delivery and $5.40 credit for the missing mango lassi. Your credit balance is now $17.40.\n- **K-6102 Burger Barn:** I refunded $11.00 to your Visa for the wrong burger (refund ID RF-4000), arriving in 3\u20135 business days.\n- **K-6103 Taqueria Luz:** I can't compensate the churros because it's past the 48-hour reporting window.\n- **K-6104 Pho Real:** You already got an automatic $4.75 refund for the iced coffee.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
